Triangle of trinomial coefficients T(n,k) (n >= 0, 0 <= k <= 2*n), read by rows: n-th row is obtained by expanding (1 + x + x^2)^n.

The 69 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A027907

